------CI vs CD files-------


| File                  | Layer       | Purpose                  |
| --------------------- | ----------- | ------------------------ |
| `pom.xml`             | Application | Maven dependencies/build |
| `package.json`        | Application | npm dependencies/build   |
| `Dockerfile`          | Container   | Build image              |
| `.dockerignore`       | Container   | Exclude files from build |
| `azure-pipelines.yml` | CI/CD       | Automate pipeline        |
| `deployment.yaml`     | Kubernetes  | Run/manage Pods          |
| `service.yaml`        | Kubernetes  | Network access           |
| `configmap.yaml`      | Kubernetes  | Non-secret configuration |
| `secret.yaml`         | Kubernetes  | Secret configuration     |
| `ingress.yaml`        | Kubernetes  | HTTP/HTTPS routing       |
| `hpa.yaml`            | Kubernetes  | Autoscaling              |
| `Chart.yaml`          | Helm        | Chart definition         |
| `values.yaml`         | Helm        | Configuration values     |

